# The order Netnyahoo's changes go into the CEF/Chromium tree (docs/cef-source-build.md › "The patch series").
#
#   cef <patch>       a patch to CEF's own tree (chromium/src/cef), step 2, before CEF's gclient hook
#   chromium <patch>  a patch to chromium/src, after ungoogled-chromium and domain substitution (step 4)
#   layer <dir>       our own files, copied in by <dir>/apply.sh (engine/<layer>/src mirrors chromium/src)
#
# Lines run top to bottom; a patch is made against the tree as every line above it leaves it.
# One concern per patch, named for it; a new patch goes where it belongs, not where its name sorts.

cef cef-chrome-tabs.patch
